{
  "info": {
    "name": "Bandung Spiders API v1",
    "description": "REST API Bandung Spiders Basketball (PWL Kelompok 2).\n\n1. Jalankan `php artisan serve` (port 8000).\n2. Buka folder **0. Masuk** dan jalankan salah satu request masuk. Token otomatis disimpan ke variabel `token`.\n3. Jalankan request lain. Request POST otomatis menyimpan id data baru (member_id, ku_id, jadwal_id, coach_id) untuk dipakai GET/PUT/PATCH/DELETE berikutnya.\n\nAkun contoh (kata sandi `password`): admin@spiders.test (Admin), dita@spiders.test (coach), rina.pratama@gmail.com (orang tua).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "member_id",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "ku_id",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "jadwal_id",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "coach_id",
      "value": "2"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Masuk",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Masuk sebagai Admin",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
